      "product_faq": [
        {
          "question": "Which materials are confirmed?",
          "answer": "The upper is EVA. Separate lining, midsole and ground-contact outsole formulations are not specified. Send any material requirements for confirmation before order."
        },
        {
          "question": "Which colours and sizes can I request?",
          "answer": "Blue, Khaki, Beige, Light Pink and Black. Size choices are the three paired labels 35-36, 37-38 and 39-40. Send your size mix and fit requirements; US or UK size conversions are confirmed separately."
        },
        {
          "question": "What are the MOQ and reference price tiers?",
          "answer": "MOQ is 2 pairs. Reference price is USD 5.16 for 2-49 pairs, USD 4.81 for 50-99 pairs and USD 4.47 for 100 pairs or more. Freight and final order terms are confirmed separately."
        },
        {
          "question": "How do I check fit and strap requirements?",
          "answer": "The pictures show the pivot strap in its forward position. Share your fit measurements and intended use so size selection and strap requirements can be confirmed for your order."
        },
        {
          "question": "Can I request samples or custom packaging?",
          "answer": "Send your sample quantity, branding and packing requirements. Feasibility, charges, minimum quantities and timing are assessed before quotation."
        },
        {
          "question": "How are availability and dispatch confirmed?",
          "answer": "Send colour-size quantities, destination and required date. Availability, packing, freight options and dispatch timing are confirmed against the agreed order."
        }
      ],
